Package: sharpapi
Title: Client for the 'SharpAPI' Real-Time Sports Betting Odds API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SharpAPI", email = "hello@sharpapi.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access real-time sports betting odds, no-vig fair odds, expected
    value (+EV) and arbitrage opportunities from the 'SharpAPI' REST API
    <https://sharpapi.io>. Covers 45+ sportsbooks normalized into one schema.
    Requires a 'SharpAPI' key; a free tier is available.
